        kv (lck-fr us us1 j q2 t2 h2 (fr-sib-in us us1 j q2 q1 w l12 l24 p1)) (lck-fr us us1 j q3 t3 h3 (fr-sib-in us us1 j q3 q1 w l13 l34 p1)) cn))
