(def-fns _ $ (erased xt-lt : (erased (Nat) p0 p W W2) (erased (Bstack) bs) (erased (Gsym) g) (erased (XtP p0 bs g p) xp) (erased (Lt p0 W) l) (erased (Thrice W W2) tw)
